Room: Offensive Security Intro

Platform: TryHackMe
Difficulty: Easy
Date: 2026

Objective

Gain unauthorized access to the bank transfer feature and modify account balances.

Step 1: Enumeration
Web directory enumeration

Command used:

gobuster -u http://fakebank.thm -w wordlist.txt dir

Result:

Found hidden pages including /bank-transfer

Identified the admin bank transfer page via Gobuster brute-forcing.

Step 2: Vulnerability Identification

Found a hidden admin page that allows transfers between accounts (/bank-transfer) — this page was not properly protected, allowing unauthorized access without authentication.

Step 3: Exploitation

Navigated to the discovered admin transfer page in the FakeBank app and transferred funds from another account into my own.

Step 4: Outcome

Money was successfully transferred into my account — mission accomplished.

Lessons Learned

Web directory brute-forcing can help find hidden pages.

Hidden admin pages can expose critical functionality if not secured.

Gobuster is a useful tool for web enumeration in offensive security.

Tools Used

Gobuster
